From 511f4dcd642b9e8cbe017db8850e31b0e66c9a32 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pang Jiming <discrete_brain@163.com>
Date: Thu, 11 Jun 2026 17:02:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 01/43] feat(smap): add per-page cold-period counter via page
 flags

Repurpose 4 bits of LAST_CPUPID in page->flags to store a
consecutive-cold-period counter (0-15, saturating). Updated at end of
each scan period in process_scan_results() only.
---
 plugins/smap/src/drivers/accessed_bit.c    | 99 ++++++++++++++++------
 plugins/smap/src/drivers/smap_page_flags.h | 89 +++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 162 insertions(+), 26 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 plugins/smap/src/drivers/smap_page_flags.h

